---
import { engineNames, monthlyPlans } from '../data/pricing';
---
<div class="pricing-grid">
  {monthlyPlans.map((plan,index) => <article class:list={['plan',{featured:index===1}]}>
    {index===1&&<span class="plan-badge">常用方案</span>}
    <h3>{plan.name}</h3><div class="price"><span>¥</span>{plan.price}<small>/ 月</small></div>
    <p class="plan-description">{index===0?'基础翻译引擎':index===1?'更多语言与引擎选择':'全部 7 种翻译引擎'}</p>
    <div class="engine-tags" aria-label={`${plan.name}支持的引擎`}>{engineNames.map(engine => <span class:list={['engine-tag',{unavailable:!plan.engines.includes(engine)}]}>{engine}<span class="sr-only">{plan.engines.includes(engine)?'：支持':'：不包含'}</span></span>)}</div>
    <ul class="plan-features"><li>不限翻译字符数量</li><li>快捷回复、未读提醒</li><li>客户档案与跟进记录</li></ul>
    <a class:list={['button',{secondary:index!==1}]} href="/help/#download">下载软件购买</a>
  </article>)}
</div>
<p class="fine pricing-note">具体价格与套餐版本、时长有关，以软件内订单页为准。包月不自动续费。</p>
